description:
Add final review and finalization from character creation draft into the canonical playable character record.

Final review should show
- name/concept;
- level, class, ancestry, background;
- ability scores, modifiers, and method;
- HP and other derived values;
- completed required choices;
- missing required choices;
- warnings for stale or invalid selections.

Acceptance criteria
- Incomplete drafts cannot finalize and show actionable missing choices.
- Complete drafts finalize into the project's canonical character representation.
- Finalization preserves provenance/rules-pack IDs needed for later play/audit.
- Tests cover successful finalization and blocked finalization.
